===========================================================================
Install this package and its dependencies with PKG_RCD_SCRIPTS=yes to install
the standard rc.d files. Package installation does not start Plasma.

In /etc/rc.conf, enable the existing system bus and select an existing account:
    dbus=YES
    ember_plasma=YES
    ember_plasma_user=desktopuser

The default is disabled. Do not select root. This is an intentional automatic
unauthenticated session. Device access and seat policy remain administrator
choices. The service creates no accounts and changes no device permissions.
===========================================================================
